--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled chess piece sets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The 40 piece sets under src/renderer/public/pieces (excluding "bunny", which
is generated by this project) originate from the Lichess project. Licences
vary per set and are recorded per-set in:

    src/renderer/public/pieces/COPYING.md
    src/renderer/src/data/pieceLicenses.json

Fifteen of those sets are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and may not be used
commercially. The Settings screen flags each of these individually.

